<span class="pink-text"><span class="char-name">Carter</span>’s cheeks are bright red, and his eyes are starting to well up as he stands there out in the open, butt naked except for his shoes.</span> <span class="dialogue-text">“Are my-”</span> He asks, turning to you. You point down at the ground, where the scraps you brought down with you fell. <span class="pink-text">His clothes are utterly destroyed, with no hope of using them to cover himself with. <span class="dialogue-text">“I- I see…”</span> <span class="char-name">Carter</span> is frozen, staring down at his shreds of clothing as he covers himself with his hands. He was shivering as the cold winds blow over his exposed body.</span><br>

